  "source": "# The crossing\n\nKydux's own art, made for the game and under the GNU GPL, version 3 or\nlater, like the rest of it.\n\n- Painted by Gemini 3 Pro Image (`gemini-3-pro-image`) from\n  `tools/art/prompts/scene-tunnel-exit.md`, then edited by it without its\n  grid (`game-crossing-nogrid.md`).\n- The corridor beside the statues made three cells wide by\n  `tools/art/repaint.py spaced`.\n- The pale paper round the castle painted as its inside by Gemini from\n  `game-crossing-voids.md` and `game-crossing-voids-more.md`, joined by\n  `tools/art/repaint.py`, and what still was black tiled from the picture's\n  own stones (`tiled`); `game-crossing-voids-top.md` was asked first and kept\n  the paper as the page.\n- A black sliver over the tunnel's arch filled from the pixels round it (`fill`).\n- Its statues and its low arch cut by the polygons traced round them.\n",
